24512 Tw T* (AngelSense, and Empatica. Based on this review, we identify five recurring gaps in existing systems and)Tj .50048 Tw T* (describe how a thirteen-engine AI architecture, together with a curated set of public benchmark datasets, could)Tj .5728 Tw T* (address them. We further specify the companion mobile application that exposes this architecture to end users)Tj 1.056 Tw 0 -29 TD (for children, elderly users, and women's safety, a complete emergency and incident-review subsystem, and a)Tj 1.712 Tw 0 -14.5 TD <477561726469616e2063617265676976696e67206c61796572209720746f6765746865722077697468206974732050686f6e652d4f6e6c7920616e642046756c6c205765617261626c65206f7065726174696e67206d6f64657320616e642061207769646572>Tj .785723 Tw T* (multi-platform companion ecosystem, and we specify the physical wearable itself as an Engineering Validation)Tj 2.0976 Tw T* (Test \(EVT\) prototype: a nine-subsystem, MCU-orchestrated hardware platform with a defined sensor suite,)Tj 2.6328 Tw T* (communication subsystem, power system, bill of materials, PCB layout, mechanical design, and firmware)Tj .4992 Tw T* (architecture. We conclude with an assessment of patentable sub-systems, a research novelty statement, and a)Tj 0 Tw T* (state-of-the-art comparison table.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 317.4 cm .231373 .27451 .321569 rg BT 2.058831 Tw/F3 9.6 Tf 0 19.4 TD (Keywords:)Tj/F1 9.6 Tf ( Wearable AI, Personal Safety, Fall Detection, Digital Twin, Sensor Fusion, Edge AI, Predictive)Tj 0 Tw 0 -14.5 TD (Health Monitoring, TinyML, Human Activity Recognition, Emergency Response Systems)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 251.4 cm .043137 .121569 .227451 rg BT/F3 17 Tf 0 4 TD (Table of Contents)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 240.3 cm .054902 .647059 .627451 RG 1 J 1.1 w 0 0 m 477.6 0 l S Q q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 199.3 cm .043137 .121569 .227451 rg BT/F3 10.3 Tf 471.8732 5.7 TD (2)Tj ET BT/F3 10.3 Tf T* (Abstract)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 67.2 167.3 cm .043137 .121569 .227451 rg BT/F3 10.3 Tf 471.8732 5.7 TD (2)Tj ET BT/F3 10.3 